  "stageId": "a003_08",
  "title": "Siesta Rhapsody",
  "storyCode": "OF-8",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_08_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "62be42f81c20cbe78e44e4b3f1fc6d3e53b4483cd7ae2a45d4ae8962f0645700",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceylon",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "Watch out!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Provence",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "Haah!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skyfire",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "Hyah!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceylon",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#2",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "Is it really getting weaker? I can't tell from the appearance at all!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skyfire",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "Watch out for the lava! Just how much obsidian has this thing absorbed?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Giant Originium Slug",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "GROOOAAAAARRRRR!!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Provence",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "Poor thing... But we can't afford to show it any mercy! Skyfire!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skyfire",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "All right, I got it! Time to go all out!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skyfire",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "Well then, how do you like the taste of this?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Giant Originium Slug",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Grooooooarrr!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceylon",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "It's becoming enraged...! I'll block its way. The rest of you, focus on attacking!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skyfire",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#1",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "Big tail!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Provence",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "I finally managed to land a hit through a crack in the lava, but I can't guarantee that it's going to work on something of this size!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Giant Originium Slug",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——————!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skyfire",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#3",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "We did it! It's heading the other way!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Provence",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "Yes! The citizens are going to be safe now!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skyfire",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#2",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "Good grief! I can't believe a single slug would be that hard to deal with! My skirt is all ruined..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Provence",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "It was the leader of the colony after all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Provence",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "If people didn't destroy their habitat in the first place, then perhaps..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skyfire",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#2",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "I'm exhausted! Let's not bring up that tiresome topic again!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceylon",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#6",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "Haha, me too. I'm so tired I can barely stand."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceylon",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#6",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "But, we have to head back to Siesta. There are people waiting for us there..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceylon",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#7",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "Oof!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Provence",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "That's understandable, but a mature lady should also learn to get help if she's not even able to keep her balance."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceylon",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#7",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "Th-thank you..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skyfire",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#2",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "All right, let's go take our victory lap now. Once we get back, there might still be some time for us to enjoy our vacation."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Provence",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "But... sooner or later, this place will..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skyfire",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#2",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "Big tail?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Provence",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "Ah, I'm coming."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Provence",
      "speakerToken": "char_145_prove_1",
      "operatorId": "char_145_prove",
      "portraitKey": "char_145_prove",
      "text": "Skyfire..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skyfire",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#2",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "I know."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skyfire",
      "speakerToken": "char_166_skfire_3#2",
      "operatorId": "char_166_skfire",
      "portraitKey": "char_166_skfire",
      "text": "But we should respect the city's choice, and let them handle the rest, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
